  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1206.09 Application Signatories and Certification Requirements for Reports",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1206.09 Application Signatories and Certification Requirements for Reports. All applications and reports required under this part shall:\n\n(a) Be signed pursuant to Env-Wq 1206.08; and\n\n(b) Contain the following certification statement:\n\n“I certify under penalty of law that the information in this document and any attachments hereto is to the best of my knowledge and belief true, accurate, and complete. I am aware that there are significant penalties for submitting false information, including the possibility of fines and imprisonment for knowing violations.”\n\nSource. #8235, eff 12-22-04 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1200) (formerly Env-Ws 1206.09); ss by #9798-B, eff 10-9-10; ss by #12739, eff 3-19-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1200.html"
